.claude/skills/build-manuscript/
.claude/skills/check-new-data/
.claude/skills/edit-manuscript/
.claude/skills/iterate-figures/
.claude/skills/preview-experiments/
.claude/skills/regen-experiments/
.claude/skills/rename-concept/
.claude/skills/rerun-lm-elicitation/

# PNG previews of the generated figures. The committed artifacts are the PDFs
# (Illustrator places PDFs, and a PNG beside each would double the repo's figure
# weight for a preview that regenerates in seconds).
figures/**/*.png

# Diagnostics that render into figures/si/ but are not paper figures: nothing in
# the SI cites them and the journal sync does not copy them. Their scripts stay
# committed — each is the only view of something the paper still depends on, or
# still prints numbers the SI quotes — but their output is regenerated on demand
# rather than tracked alongside the figures that are actually in the paper.
figures/si/si_model_scatter_all.pdf
figures/si/si_prior_posterior_distributions.pdf
figures/si/si_prereg_deviation.pdf

.agents/skills
